# Origin of the Hollowmark game server (Colyseus). Copy this file to
# `.env` for a custom local setup, or set VITE_SERVER_URL in your host's
# build environment (e.g. Vercel project env vars) for production.
#
# Leave it UNSET for the default local-dev behaviour: the client talks to
# `<page-host>:2567` over a protocol matching the page (ws/http, or wss/https).
#
# For a hosted build, point it at the deployed server's PUBLIC origin.
# Use https:// — the client turns it into wss:// for the gameplay socket,
# and an HTTPS site will refuse an insecure ws:// connection.
#
# VITE_SERVER_URL=https://api.hollowmark.com
